From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Travis Mills <travismills82@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 21:11:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] vold: bridge Infiniti Android 16 FBE services

Teach the Android 12.1 recovery vold path to use the OnePlus 15 AIDL
Gatekeeper and Weaver services while retaining its legacy HIDL fallback.
Bound Keystore startup waits, keep successful CE unlock state across a data
refresh, tolerate an existing key-upgrade directory, and avoid rejecting a
filesystem key solely because the optional recovery keyring cache is absent.

These changes keep missing proprietary services fail-closed without freezing
the recovery UI.
---

